    "Professional Summary": "Muhtasari wa Kitaaluma",
    "Accomplished senior software development engineer and AI leader with over 15 years of professional experience. Proven track record in designing, coding, and maintaining robust full-stack software architectures, database systems, and mechatronic systems. Combines academic rigor with applied engineering to deliver scalable digital services, machine vision networks, and autonomous hardware-software integrations.": "Mhandisi mwandamizi wa maendeleo ya programu na kiongozi wa akili bandia mwenye uzoefu wa zaidi ya miaka 15. Ana rekodi thabiti ya kubuni, kuandika na kudumisha usanifu imara wa programu kamili, mifumo ya hifadhidata na mifumo ya mekatroniki. Anaunganisha taaluma na uhandisi wa vitendo kutoa huduma za kidijitali zinazokua, mitandao ya maono ya mashine na uunganishaji wa vifaa na programu unaojiendesha.",
    "Research & Science": "Utafiti na Sayansi",
    "Engineering Impact": "Athari ya Kiuhandisi",
    "Led SUA's digital transformation roadmap as HEET Component Leader. Coordinates cross-disciplinary teams for higher education & agriculture systems.": "Aliongoza ramani ya mageuzi ya kidijitali ya SUA kama Kiongozi wa Sehemu ya HEET. Huratibu timu za taaluma mbalimbali kwa mifumo ya elimu ya juu na kilimo.",
    "Published 57+ scholarly works (55 peer-reviewed articles & book chapters, 2 preprints) in agricultural AI, robotics, and remote sensing. Google Scholar (checked November 19, 2026): 1,225 citations, h-index 18, and i10-index 26.": "Amechapisha zaidi ya kazi 57 za kitaaluma (makala 55 yaliyopitiwa na wataalamu na sura za vitabu, pamoja na machapisho mawili ya awali) kuhusu AI ya kilimo, roboti na uchunguzi wa mbali. Google Scholar (Novemba 19, 2026): nukuu 1,225, faharasa h ya 18 na faharasa i10 ya 26.",
    "Designed autonomous field robots, smart irrigation scheduling systems, and custom database networks for institutional monitoring.": "Alibuni roboti za shambani zinazojiendesha, mifumo mahiri ya kupanga umwagiliaji na mitandao ya hifadhidata maalumu kwa ufuatiliaji wa taasisi.",
    "Led the team winning the global AI for Equity Challenge (UNESCO-IRCAI, Zindi, and AWS) with $25k in cloud credits.": "Aliongoza timu iliyoshinda Shindano la Kimataifa la AI for Equity (UNESCO-IRCAI, Zindi na AWS) kwa mikopo ya wingu yenye thamani ya dola za Marekani 25,000.",
