    "Research Grants & Funding Portfolio": "Kwingineko ya Ruzuku za Utafiti na Ufadhili",
    "Competitive research funding and academic grants secured as PI or co-PI.": "Ufadhili wa ushindani wa utafiti na ruzuku za kitaaluma zilizopatikana akiwa mtafiti mkuu au mtafiti mkuu msaidizi.",
    "Applying Social Semiotic Approach to Revolutionize Access to University Resources with ICT Solution": "Kutumia Mbinu ya Semiolojia ya Kijamii Kubadilisha Upatikanaji wa Rasilimali za Chuo kwa Suluhisho la TEHAMA",
    "Towards deploying low-cost Soil Testing device for Rural farmers powered by AI and machine learning": "Kuelekea matumizi ya kifaa cha gharama nafuu cha kupima udongo kwa wakulima wa vijijini kwa kutumia akili bandia na kujifunza kwa mashine",
    "Promoting Efficient Sharing of the Agro-mechanization": "Kukuza Ushirikishaji Wenye Ufanisi wa Mitambo ya Kilimo",
    "Prediction of the Rain-fed Maize Yield in Tanzania using Time-series Machine Learning Models": "Utabiri wa Mavuno ya Mahindi ya Kutegemea Mvua Tanzania kwa Miundo ya Kujifunza kwa Mashine ya Mfululizo wa Muda",
    "Dataset for Predictive Machine Learning, supported by Lacuna fund and funded by The Rockefeller foundation and IDRC": "Seti ya data kwa ujifunzaji wa mashine wa utabiri, ikiungwa mkono na Mfuko wa Lacuna na kufadhiliwa na Wakfu wa Rockefeller na IDRC",
    "Towards a Nationwide Automatic Irrigation Scheduling System using Geospatial Artificial Intelligence": "Kuelekea Mfumo wa Kitaifa wa Kupanga Umwagiliaji Kiotomatiki kwa Kutumia Akili Bandia ya Kijiografia",
    "Courses taught across graduate and undergraduate levels. Topics emphasize hands-on skills in programming, embedded systems, networking, and agricultural applications of AI and IoT.": "Kozi zinazofundishwa katika ngazi ya uzamili na shahada ya kwanza. Mada zinatilia mkazo ujuzi wa vitendo katika upangaji, mifumo iliyojengwa, mitandao na matumizi ya AI na IoT katika kilimo.",
    "Research Mentorship": "Ushauri wa Utafiti",
    "Supervising and mentoring PhD and MSc research students from:": "Kusimamia na kuwaelekeza wanafunzi wa utafiti wa uzamivu na uzamili kutoka:",
    "CIRAWA Agroecology Conference Training": "Mafunzo ya Mkutano wa Kilimoekolojia wa CIRAWA",
    "Attended training in Earth Observation Climate Data Analysis in Accra, Ghana.": "Nilihudhuria mafunzo ya uchambuzi wa data za hali ya hewa kwa uchunguzi wa Dunia mjini Accra, Ghana.",
    "Development of the Education Simulator for Ministry of EST": "Uundaji wa Kiigaji cha Elimu kwa Wizara ya EST",
    "Scientific Conference Presentation": "Wasilisho katika Mkutano wa Kisayansi",
    "Paper Accepted in Frontiers": "Karatasi Iliyokubaliwa katika Frontiers",
    "Jifunze Zaidi about my professional journey, Wasifu, and engineering expertise.": "Jifunze zaidi kuhusu safari yangu ya kitaaluma, wasifu wangu na utaalamu wa uhandisi.",
    "Explore my current and past research projects in AI, robotics, and agriculture.": "Gundua miradi yangu ya sasa na ya awali ya akili bandia, roboti na kilimo.",
    "View my complete list of peer-reviewed journal articles, citation metrics, and papers.": "Angalia orodha kamili ya makala ya majarida yaliyopitiwa na wataalamu, vipimo vya nukuu na karatasi.",
    "Dr. Kadeghe \"Kade\" Goodluck Fue is a senior lecturer, registered professional engineer, and researcher focused on Precision Agriculture, modeling and simulation, agricultural robotics, and artificial intelligence. His work applies remote sensing, sensing networks, and intelligent systems to challenges in crop production, irrigation, and sustainable farming.": "Dk. Kadeghe “Kade” Goodluck Fue ni mhadhiri mwandamizi, mhandisi mtaalamu aliyesajiliwa na mtafiti anayejikita katika kilimo cha usahihi, uundaji wa miundo na uigaji, roboti za kilimo na akili bandia. Kazi yake inatumia uchunguzi wa mbali, mitandao ya vihisi na mifumo akili kukabiliana na changamoto za uzalishaji wa mazao, umwagiliaji na kilimo endelevu.",
    "He combines agricultural engineering and field research with machine learning, robotics, modeling, and simulation to develop practical, data-informed tools. His broader engineering experience in software architecture, databases, and hardware-software integration supports the design and deployment of these research systems.": "Anaunganisha uhandisi wa kilimo na utafiti wa shambani na ujifunzaji wa mashine, roboti, uundaji wa miundo na uigaji ili kutengeneza zana za vitendo zinazotegemea data. Uzoefu wake mpana wa uhandisi wa usanifu wa programu, hifadhidata na uunganishaji wa vifaa na programu huwezesha usanifu na utekelezaji wa mifumo hii.",
    "USDA/USAID funded initiative empowering youth through computer vision, robotics, and physical AI hackathons.": "Mpango uliofadhiliwa na USDA/USAID unaowawezesha vijana kupitia maono ya kompyuta, roboti na mashindano ya akili bandia halisi.",
    "Precision aerial remote sensing, autonomous agricultural spraying rovers, and IoT telemetry architectures.": "Uchunguzi sahihi wa mbali kwa angani, magari ya kunyunyizia yanayojiendesha na usanifu wa telemetri wa IoT.",
    "Global 1st place UNESCO-IRCAI AI for Equity solution predicting crop yield from time-series satellite signals.": "Suluhisho la nafasi ya kwanza duniani la AI for Equity la UNESCO-IRCAI linalotabiri mavuno kwa mawimbi ya satelaiti ya mfululizo wa wakati.",
    "Nationwide automatic irrigation scheduling merging wireless IoT soil nodes, weather telemetry, and satellite GeoAI.": "Upangaji wa umwagiliaji wa kiotomatiki nchini kwa kuunganisha vihisi vya udongo visivyotumia waya vya IoT, telemetri ya hali ya hewa na GeoAI ya satelaiti.",
    "Open course materials, lecture notes, tutorials, practical exercises, and assessments in agricultural engineering, electronics, programming, embedded systems, Precision Agriculture, artificial intelligence, IoT, and GIS.": "Nyenzo huria za kozi, mihadhara, mafunzo, mazoezi ya vitendo na tathmini katika uhandisi wa kilimo, elektroniki, upangaji, mifumo iliyojengwa, kilimo cha usahihi, akili bandia, IoT na GIS.",
