    "Smart IoT Trap for Fruit Flies in Avocados": "Mtego Mahiri wa IoT wa Inzi wa Matunda kwenye Parachichi",
    "Research Grants & Funding Portfolio": "Kwingineko ya Ruzuku za Utafiti na Ufadhili",
    "15+ Years of Systems Engineering & Consultancy": "Zaidi ya Miaka 15 ya Uhandisi wa Mifumo na Ushauri",
    "Explore Dr. Fue's comprehensive portfolio of 20+ major software solutions, databases, and digital transformation initiatives completed for government ministries, academic centers, and international agencies.": "Gundua kwingineko pana ya Dk. Fue yenye suluhisho zaidi ya 20 za programu, hifadhidata na mageuzi ya kidijitali kwa wizara, taasisi za elimu na mashirika ya kimataifa.",
    "Comprehensive technical expertise spanning full-stack development, geospatial software engineering, robotics engineering, artificial intelligence, and autonomous systems architecture with 15+ years of professional experience.": "Utaalamu mpana wa kiufundi unaojumuisha maendeleo ya mifumo kamili, uhandisi wa programu za kijiografia, uhandisi wa roboti, akili bandia na usanifu wa mifumo inayojiendesha, kwa uzoefu wa zaidi ya miaka 15.",
    "Architecting scalable enterprise applications, robust databases, and distributed systems. Expert in full-stack clean code patterns and secure APIs.": "Kubuni programu za taasisi zinazokua, hifadhidata thabiti na mifumo iliyosambazwa; kwa umahiri wa mifumo kamili, msimbo safi na API salama.",
    "Designing and training deep neural networks and custom ML pipelines. Specialized in edge device deployment and real-time computer vision models.": "Kubuni na kufundisha mitandao ya kina ya neva na mabomba ya kujifunza kwa mashine. Utaalamu katika vifaa vya ukingoni na mifano ya maono ya kompyuta ya wakati halisi.",
    "Developing low-latency firmware and integrating microcontrollers with sensors. Specialized in reliable real-time operating systems and IoT networks.": "Kuunda programu dhibiti zenye ucheleweshaji mdogo na kuunganisha vidhibiti vidogo na vihisi. Utaalamu katika mifumo ya uendeshaji ya wakati halisi na mitandao ya IoT.",
    "Building path-planning, obstacle avoidance, and sensor fusion systems for robotics. Experienced in ROS-based autonomous navigation systems.": "Kuunda mifumo ya kupanga njia, kuepuka vikwazo na kuunganisha vihisi kwa roboti, pamoja na uzoefu katika urambazaji unaojiendesha kwa kutumia ROS.",
    "Processing and visualizing large-scale spatial and temporal datasets. Building predictive models to derive actionable insights from complex data.": "Kuchakata na kuonyesha data kubwa za kieneo na kimuda; kuunda mifano ya utabiri inayotoa maarifa yanayoweza kutekelezwa kutoka data changamano.",
    "Connecting edge sensor arrays to cloud infrastructure via secure protocols. Expert in telemetry pipelines and real-time synchronization dashboards.": "Kuunganisha vihisi vya ukingoni na miundombinu ya wingu kwa itifaki salama. Utaalamu katika mabomba ya telemetri na dashibodi za ulandanishi wa wakati halisi.",
    "Designing spatial data platforms, mapping applications, geospatial APIs, and automated remote-sensing workflows for agriculture and environmental decision support.": "Kubuni majukwaa ya data za kieneo, programu za ramani, API za kijiografia na mtiririko wa uchunguzi wa mbali unaotomatika kwa kilimo na maamuzi ya mazingira.",
    "A detailed overview of my proficiency across programming languages, frameworks, tools, and advanced technical domains.": "Muhtasari wa kina wa umahiri wangu katika lugha za programu, mifumo ya kazi, zana na maeneo ya kiufundi ya hali ya juu.",
    "Applying research in Robotics and AI to address critical global challenges and contribute to the UN Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs).": "Kutumia utafiti wa roboti na akili bandia kukabili changamoto kuu za dunia na kuchangia Malengo ya Maendeleo Endelevu ya Umoja wa Mataifa.",
    "Developing agricultural robotics, Edge AI, and precision fertilization tools to improve food security and sustainable farming.": "Kuunda roboti za kilimo, akili bandia ya ukingoni na zana za urutubishaji wa usahihi ili kuboresha usalama wa chakula na kilimo endelevu.",
    "Mentoring engineers, innovating at the university level, and contributing to national educational simulators for STEM.": "Kufunza wahandisi, kubuni katika ngazi ya chuo kikuu na kuchangia viigaji vya kitaifa vya elimu ya STEM.",
    "Pushing boundaries in autonomous systems, IoT integration, and embedded AI technologies for rapid industrialization.": "Kupanua mipaka ya mifumo inayojiendesha, uunganishaji wa IoT na teknolojia za akili bandia iliyojengwa ndani kwa viwanda.",
    "Leveraging Data Analytics and AI Weather World Models to build resilience and adapt to changing climate conditions.": "Kutumia uchanganuzi wa data na mifano ya akili bandia ya hali ya hewa kujenga ustahimilivu na kuzoea mabadiliko ya tabianchi.",
    "Served on the organizing committee and chaired the first day session at AAIAC 2026 in Dar es Salaam, Tanzania.": "Nilihudumu katika kamati ya maandalizi na kuongoza kikao cha siku ya kwanza cha AAIAC 2026 jijini Dar es Salaam, Tanzania.",
    "Attended Training in Earth Observation Climate Data Analysis in Accra, Ghana.": "Nilihudhuria mafunzo ya uchambuzi wa data za hali ya hewa kwa uchunguzi wa Dunia mjini Accra, Ghana.",
    "Dr. Fue welcomes collaboration with researchers, practitioners, and organizations on interdisciplinary research, technology development, and consulting.": "Dk. Fue anakaribisha ushirikiano na watafiti, wataalamu na taasisi katika utafiti wa taaluma mchanganyiko, maendeleo ya teknolojia na ushauri.",
    "to explore opportunities to work together.": "kuchunguza fursa za kufanya kazi pamoja.",
    "Beyond authoring research, Dr. Fue actively shapes scientific discourse as an": "Mbali na kuandika tafiti, Dk. Fue huunda majadiliano ya kisayansi kama",
    "for leading international journals, including": "wa majarida makuu ya kimataifa, yakiwemo",
    "Over 15 years of leading full-stack software development, database architecture, and technical consulting projects for government ministries, academic institutions, and international development organizations (World Bank, FAO, AGRA).": "Zaidi ya miaka 15 ya kuongoza maendeleo ya mifumo kamili, usanifu wa hifadhidata na miradi ya ushauri wa kiufundi kwa wizara, taasisi za elimu na mashirika ya maendeleo ya kimataifa (Benki ya Dunia, FAO na AGRA).",
    "Try adjusting your keywords or category filters to find the project you are looking for.": "Jaribu kubadilisha maneno muhimu au vichujio ili kupata mradi unaoutafuta.",
    "Dr. Fue provides expert advisory in software engineering, national digital gateways, agricultural robotics, and machine learning infrastructure for public and private institutions.": "Dk. Fue hutoa ushauri wa kitaalamu katika uhandisi wa programu, malango ya kidijitali ya kitaifa, roboti za kilimo na miundombinu ya kujifunza kwa mashine kwa taasisi za umma na binafsi.",
    "Highlights of media appearances, press releases, and stories featuring Dr. Fue's work in agricultural technology, Autonomous Systems, and innovation across USA, Tanzania, and globally.": "Vivutio vya mahojiano na vyombo vya habari, taarifa kwa vyombo vya habari na simulizi kuhusu kazi za Dk. Fue katika teknolojia ya kilimo, mifumo inayojiendesha na ubunifu nchini Tanzania, Marekani na duniani.",
    "Dr. Fue served on the organizing committee and chaired the first day session at the": "Dk. Fue alihudumu katika kamati ya maandalizi na kuongoza kikao cha siku ya kwanza katika",
