    "Innovation incubator empowering youth and students with hands-on robotics, AI training, hackathons, and hardware prototyping.": "Kitalu cha uvumbuzi kinachowawezesha vijana na wanafunzi kwa roboti za vitendo, mafunzo ya AI, mashindano ya uundaji na ujenzi wa mifano ya vifaa.",
